---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import BackLink from "../../components/BackLink.astro";
import { legalEntity } from "../../data/legal";
---

<Layout
	lang="en"
	title="Privacy policy — Zaviren"
	description="How we handle your personal data on zaviren.com: purpose, legal basis, processors and your rights."
	altHref="/privacidad"
>
	<section class="legal">
		<span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
		<h1>Privacy policy</h1>
		<p class="updated">Last updated: 2026-08-11</p>
		<p class="legal-note">
			This is an informational translation. The Spanish version is the
			legally binding one — see <a href="/privacidad">Política de privacidad</a>.
		</p>

		<h2>1. Data controller</h2>
		<p>
			<strong>{legalEntity.companyName}</strong>, tax ID {legalEntity.taxId}, registered address {legalEntity.address}, is the
			controller of the personal data we collect through this website.
			For any data-protection question, contact us at <a href={`mailto:${legalEntity.dpoEmail}`}>{legalEntity.dpoEmail}</a>.
		</p>

		<h2>2. What we collect and why</h2>
		<p>
			Through the contact and guide-request forms we collect: first name,
			last name, email and company. We use this data to:
		</p>
		<ul>
			<li>Respond to your contact request or commercial inquiry.</li>
			<li>Send you the downloadable guide, if requested through the corresponding form.</li>
			<li>
				Send you communications about our products and services, only if
				you checked the consent box on the form.
			</li>
		</ul>

		<h2>3. Legal basis</h2>
		<p>
			The legal basis for processing is your explicit consent, given by
			checking the corresponding box and submitting the form (GDPR art.
			6.1.a).
		</p>

		<h2>4. Processors and recipients</h2>
		<p>
			We do not share your data with third parties for purposes other
			than those stated. To provide the service, we work with the
			following processors:
		</p>
		<ul>
			<li><strong>Brevo</strong> (Sendinblue SAS, France) — contact management and email sending.</li>
			<li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> — processes the form submission (Cloudflare Workers) before forwarding it to Brevo.</li>
			<li><strong>{legalEntity.hostingProvider}</strong> — website hosting.</li>
		</ul>
		<p>
			If you consent to Google Analytics, Google (Google Ireland Ltd.)
			also acts as a processor — see our <a href="/en/cookies">cookie policy</a> for details.
		</p>

		<h2>5. Retention period</h2>
		<p>
			We keep your data for as long as there is an active business
			relationship or until you request its deletion. Otherwise, we
			periodically review and remove data that is no longer needed.
		</p>

		<h2>6. Your rights</h2>
		<p>
			You can exercise your rights of access, rectification, erasure,
			objection, restriction of processing and portability by writing to <a href={`mailto:${legalEntity.dpoEmail}`}>{legalEntity.dpoEmail}</a>.
			If you believe we haven't handled your request properly, you can
			file a complaint with the Spanish Data Protection Agency (AEPD), <a href="https://www.aepd.es" target="_blank" rel="noopener">aepd.es</a>.
		</p>

		<h2>7. Security</h2>
		<p>
			We apply reasonable technical and organizational measures to
			protect your data against unauthorized access, loss or alteration.
		</p>

		<h2>8. Minors</h2>
		<p>This website is not directed at minors.</p>

		<h2>9. Changes to this policy</h2>
		<p>
			We may update this policy to reflect regulatory or website changes.
			We recommend reviewing it periodically.
		</p>

		<BackLink lang="en" />
	</section>
</Layout>
